# Three devices without a driver interrupt: each line is reported once and
# masked. The RTC is re-armed again and again afterwards, and stays quiet;
# the keyboard still works.
define: TEST_PROBES
define: TEST_KEYBOARD
keys: a
---
rx286, test build
@bochs rx286: unhandled IRQ 6, now masked
@mame rx286: unhandled IRQ 6, now masked
@bochs rx286: unhandled IRQ 14, now masked
@mame rx286: unhandled IRQ 14, now masked
rx286: unhandled IRQ 8, now masked
probe: the RTC kept interrupting; IRQ8 stayed masked
key 1E 61
